{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309040","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130904001:1":{"text":"저야 괜찮죠! 그나저나 크림슨 고원에 가지 않았길 망정이지, 갔더라면 그곳에서 죽을뻔했어요.","source_cn":"好着呢！还好我们没去深红高原，不然这条命就得搭在这里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA30E66C6D37CEC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130904002:1":{"text":"사실 저희도 보물을 찾으러 가려고 했어요. 석양의 신의 보물에 흔들리지 않을 사람이 어디 있겠어요?","source_cn":"不过老实说，我们差点也去找宝藏了。那可是残阳神的宝藏，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E139764A5922BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130904003:1":{"text":"하지만… 뭐랄까? 여자의 육감? 어쨌든, 결국 가지 않아서 정말 다행이죠.","source_cn":"但凭借着……该怎么说呢？我精准的直觉？总之我们最后没去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4164C2048BF4DD0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1130904003":{"text":"하지만… 뭐랄까? 여자의 육감? 어쨌든, 결국 가지 않아서 정말 다행이죠.","source_cn":"但凭借着……该怎么说呢？我精准的直觉？总之我们最后没去，真是万幸啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4164C2048BF4DD0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130904004:1":{"text":"…아잇, 그런 건 모른 척 넘어가세요!","source_cn":"……哎，别戳穿我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF418D924CB47BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"사막의 발톱을 만날까 봐 두려워서 안 간 건 아니고?","source_cn":"不是因为怕遇见流沙之爪？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4562E1CBEFFD3FEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사막의 발톱을 만날까 봐 두려워서 안 간 건 아니고?","female":"사막의 발톱을 만날까 봐 두려워서 안 간 건 아니고?","variant_male_record_index":"63460","variant_female_record_index":"63461","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商维娅帕里":{"text":"행상 베아파리","source":"行商维娅帕里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":1}}